                    book together.</li>
                  <li><strong>Try Free, Own Forever:</strong> Download and try for free, then unlock the full app
                    forever with a single one-time purchase. 100% offline, ad-free, and tracking-free.</li>
                </ul>
                <%- include('../../partials/guide-kidamame-gallery') %>
